  "description": "Trace nonsingular generalized continued-fraction convergents with Lentz's C/D ratio recurrence over a finite field.",
  "source": {
    "title": "NIST DLMF §3.10(iii), with the detailed Lentz recurrence in Thompson and Barnett (1986), Appendix III",
